{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 24, :comments ["<b>You who fear:</b> The vav of הללוהו returns to His name mentioned above. And these are those who fear YHWH among the nations; therefore the word כל is absent, unlike: כל זרע יעקב." "And He said to Israel, גורו — that they should all be fearers, and if their hand prevails over their enemies, they shall give the might to HaShem."], :book :psalms, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 22, :notes {0 "Resolved הללוהו as the form Ibn Ezra quotes from the verse context; the vav-conjunction's referent is his grammatical point."}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Psalms -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/tehilim"] ["Wikisource Mikraot Gedolot" "http://en.wikisource.org/wiki/Mikraot_Gedolot/"] ["Tanakh, Venice, 1617-1619" "https://dlib.rsl.ru/viewer/01007514045#?page=4"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:28:17.859277147Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}